This package is a port of the context-compaction policy found in OpenCode
(https://github.com/sst/opencode), which is distributed under the MIT License.
The ported material comprises the budget-ceiling policy, the structured summary
template and its validation rules, the checkpoint wire format, the
flatten-and-drop-oldest fallback, the tool-output truncation rule, and the
token-estimation heuristic. The DSH transaction mechanics (durable compaction
markers, surface replacement, tool-pairing validation) follow
@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction and @deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-basic.

